  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Your lower arm is impaled, the weapon passing between the radius and the ulna (the two long bones in the forearm). Luckily for you, the edges of the weapon passed between most of the nerves and blood vessels on its path, rather than severing them.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> You gain @Condition[Stunned] (2) and @Condition[Bleeding] (1). You hand is useless for the rest of the encounter (see under @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.zyocWSzEZEC826NS]{Amputated Parts}) and you also suffer a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.GlShFJF2TpsNh1FX]{Torn Muscle (Minor)}.</p>"
    },
